  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Response to Pakistan Floods 2022 - Food Assistance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment is an emergency response package following extensive flooding in Pakistan in 2022. It includes in-kind food distribution and associated operational support, with a focus on the most vulnerable flood-affected people, including women and children. It is delivered by the United Nations World Food Programme and their partner NGOs working in Pakistan. This support is provided in the financial year 2022-23 across Pakistan. It is the first phase of Australia&apos;s emergency assistance to the 2022 floods in Pakistan.</narrative>
  </description>
